Only for SCTLR_EL1.

SCTLR_EL2, annoyingly enough, isn't, owing to plenty of bits depending
on E2H. It's on my long list of things to address, but I'd like a
common mechanism that'd deal with horrors such as CNTHCTL_EL2...

